{
  "label": "convenience5",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label convenience5:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene norikobreak1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/norikobreak1.webp",
      "alt": "norikobreak1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I show up at the convenience store to find it completely empty.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I steal everything and go home.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Just kidding.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I do stand there for a mildly concerning amount of time, though.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Leaving the counter in a place like this unattended isn’t exactly a good move, especially considering I could reach over and open the register whenever I want.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Granted, there are probably cameras installed and I can’t imagine it would be particularly hard to identify someone who looks like me.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "So I guess I’ll just keep waiting until Noriko shows up.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay, I’m done with this.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I turn around to leave and-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Psst!",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene norikobreak2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/norikobreak2.webp",
      "alt": "norikobreak2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hi.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Did you really just let me stand at the counter that entire time without saying anything?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I was just admiring that you’re equally as cute from behind as you are from the front.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Also, I thought you’d be smart enough to maybe look behind you once or twice before giving up and going home.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Always look forward, Noriko. Let this be your lesson for the day.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What if somebody taps on my shoulder or something?",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just keep on walking.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This sounds like bad advice.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It's a lot more motivational without any follow-ups.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene norikobreak3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/norikobreak3.webp",
      "alt": "norikobreak3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So...did you actually come here of your own volition today? Or did you just happen to wander in coincidentally again?",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My appearance is very much intentional. I’m here to hang out with you.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you on break or something?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene norikobreak4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/norikobreak4.webp",
      "alt": "norikobreak4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m pretty much always on break.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": People don’t like to walk around this neighborhood at night, so we’re dead for most of the hours that I'm here.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You should see the place at like 3:00 AM. Total ghost town. Or...ghost store, I guess.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You don’t actually work that late do you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not all the time, but I have in the past. Normally during summer or winter break, though. Just for extra money and stuff.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I applaud your work ethic. I can barely handle the hours I put in at[school].",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene norikobreak5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/norikobreak5.webp",
      "alt": "norikobreak5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sure it’s really taxing for you to just show up and do nothing every day, huh?",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You have no idea.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene norikobreak2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/norikobreak2.webp",
      "alt": "norikobreak2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, hey. If you ever need any help around the class or anything, I’d be more than willing to lend a hand.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sure you’ve got loads of clerical stuff piling up by now, right?",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, not really. The class rep normally handles all of that for me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is she in love with you too?",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maybe?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well that’s just fucking great.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Or maybe not. I don’t know. Please don’t kill her.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene norikobreak6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/norikobreak6.webp",
      "alt": "norikobreak6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not going to kill her. It’s just...",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": More and more people keep getting in between us and I kind of want them to at least let me catch up first.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Like, I’m way behind in everything except for stuff that you can’t even remember yet.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": On the bright side, I’m giving you plenty of time to catch up with how much I’m starting to visit your workplace.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene norikobreak7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/norikobreak7.webp",
      "alt": "norikobreak7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah...But do you think that maybe you’d visit me more if I worked a little closer to the dorms?",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene norikobreak8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/norikobreak8.webp",
      "alt": "norikobreak8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh! How do you think I would look as a maid?!",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ami and that really short girl with the surprisingly large chest work there, right?!",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That seems easy enough. And a lot more exciting than sitting around eating prepackaged vegan sushi all night.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m actually not sure how you’d look in a maid uniform.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene norikobreak9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/norikobreak9.webp",
      "alt": "norikobreak9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Because I’m not girly enough?",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes. And no.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ve just never seen you in anything girlier than your pajamas, so it’s hard for me to envision it.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene norikobreak10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/norikobreak10.webp",
      "alt": "norikobreak10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can be girly!",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Let me come over and try on Ami’s uniform. She’ll let me.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you sure about that?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If she doesn’t, you can hold her down and I can run into her room and raid her closet.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I thought you didn’t like dressing like that? Because of...your expression or whatever it was.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene norikobreak11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/norikobreak11.webp",
      "alt": "norikobreak11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well it would obviously be different if it was for a job.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maids are just personas those girls put on to trick gullible men like you into giving them all of your money.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can assure you that I am fully aware of how greatly I am taken advantage of inside that place. Gullibility has nothing to do with it.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The last thing I need is one more girl who’s able to peer into my soul that effectively.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene norikobreak12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/norikobreak12.webp",
      "alt": "norikobreak12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you sure about that, Sensei?",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ve told you before that I bring both the childhood friend trope and the little sister trope to the table.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene norikobreak13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/norikobreak13.webp",
      "alt": "norikobreak13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Unless...Onii-chan just doesn’t want to see his sister in a dress because he’ll realize how quickly she’s growing up...",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not the same girl I used to be, Onii-chan. I have...feelings.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have...needs.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I look down to find that I am already reaching into my wallet for spare change.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Damn all of these girls.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": As good as I think you’d be at the maid cafe, I don’t see a need for you to relocate just for me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Noriko?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene norikobreak14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/norikobreak14.webp",
      "alt": "norikobreak14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t you want to fulfill my needs, Onii-chan?...",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene norikobreak15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/norikobreak15.webp",
      "alt": "norikobreak15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Pfft!",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can’t keep a straight face anymore, I’m sorry.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You are...actually a pretty good actor.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, stop. A good actor wouldn’t break out in laughter after delivering a line like that.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene norikobreak16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/norikobreak16.webp",
      "alt": "norikobreak16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Also...it’s not really acting.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I obviously think of you when...yeah.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But it is kind of embarrassing saying it out loud.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I feel like you’ve said much worse and gotten much less embarrassed.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene norikobreak17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/norikobreak17.webp",
      "alt": "norikobreak17"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The mood someone is in when they say something greatly impacts the way in which it’s delivered, Onii-chan.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If I’m turned on while I talk to you about being turned-on, I’ll probably be a lot more reserved than I would be if I was feeling totally normal.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you...actually turned on right now?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene norikobreak18",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/norikobreak18.webp",
      "alt": "norikobreak18"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think this “Onii-chan” thing might be a kink for me.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The more I think about it...the more I...",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Earth to Noriko.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene norikobreak19",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/norikobreak19.webp",
      "alt": "norikobreak19"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes! Noriko! Me! Hi!",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What’s up?",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just trying to figure out how I should handle the horny version of you.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why would you word it like that?! That’s just going to make it worse!",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Also, I...",
      "spk": "Noriko",
